en schilder die jarenlang met een vroegere vriend in een leeg hotel leefde. Gesprekken en foto''s brengen hun onderlinge verhouding naar voren. Het voorgenomen historische onderzoek verandert zo in een zoektocht naar herinneringen, verraad en levens die door onbereikbare verwachtingen zijn gevormd.","work_id":987144012,"evidence":[{"note":"Spergebied1991 DutchPaperback9789023431930. LouisFerron and AloysiusFerron shareISNI0000000080166940/VIAF93106048/Q2268819; no mergebasedonname. Historicfiction narrative notverifiedhistoricalclaims.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p083884610"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-045.json#316","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:13:56.273Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-014.json","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/thes/p068434685","https://www.deslegte.com/spergebied-1295460/","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL846581W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p083884610"]},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"note":"Exactsource-coverattempt retained; noverifiedasset imported. Inspect actualsameeditionresolver or documentedneutralplaceholder hosted. No cross-editionlanguagecover replacement.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789023431930","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":7347643,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"da70559e4d5f2dd3576e79714062a3263062ebe5401e0ef0ac880c708f94ec64"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:13:56.273Z","editionKey":"/books/OL1294392M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/th